# VHS M1: Settings > Photo defaults to Light outside BCM2712 / BCM2711 / BCM2837 (D6 ruling): the Light mode
# streams.
title VHS M1 on a board of the Other SoC class (the amd64 tablet): Light, the preview at 720p
sizes 800x480
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565
env VHS_FAKE 1
env VHS_SOC other

wait 1500
shot 01-light
expect text "1280x720  30 fps"
key esc
expect quit
